@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain

title UnmarkCommand: remove one attendance entry
participant "command:UnmarkCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
participant "pending:ModelManager" as Model MODEL_COLOR
participant "student:Person" as Student MODEL_COLOR
[-> Command : execute(pending)
activate Command
Command -> Command : findStudent(pending)
Command -> Model : getAddressBook().getPersonList()
Model --> Command : all students
Command -> Student : getAttendance()
Student --> Command : attendance records
note over Command, Student
Successful path: student and attendance entry exist.
Match the date and group, remove only that entry,
and create updatedStudent with other fields retained.
Current group membership is not required.
end note
Command -> Model : setPerson(student, updatedStudent)
[<-- Command : result
deactivate Command
@enduml
